---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | KRIYANO"
  description="Read the KRIYANO Privacy Policy and learn how website data, analytics, cookies and third-party services may be handled."
>
  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-kicker">Legal</div>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-intro">
        This Privacy Policy explains how KRIYANO may collect, use and protect
        information when you visit or use this website.
      </p>

      <p class="updated">Last updated: October 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-section">
    <div class="container legal-layout">
      <article class="legal-content">
        <section>
          <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
          <p>
            KRIYANO does not currently require visitors to create an account or
            provide personal information in order to browse most of the website.
          </p>

          <p>
            Basic technical and usage information may be collected automatically
            when you visit the site. This can include information such as browser
            type, device type, operating system, approximate location, pages
            visited, referring pages, performance data and general website usage
            information. Where analytics is enabled, some of this information is
            collected through cookies and similar identifiers as described
            below.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>2. Website analytics</h2>
          <p>
            KRIYANO uses analytics to understand how visitors use the website,
            identify technical issues and improve site performance and usability.
            We use this information in aggregate and do not use it to identify you
            personally.
          </p>

          <p>
            <strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics.</strong> The website is served
            through Cloudflare, which provides website traffic, performance and
            analytics features. Cloudflare may process technical information in
            accordance with its own privacy practices. Cloudflare Web Analytics
            does not use cookies.
          </p>

          <p>
            <strong>Google Analytics 4.</strong> We also use Google Analytics 4
            (Measurement ID: <code>G-GT7Q9ETXYM</code>), a service provided by
            Google. Google Analytics uses cookies and similar identifiers to
            collect information such as pages viewed, approximate location,
            device and browser type, referring pages and session interactions.
            This data is processed by Google on our behalf and may be processed on
            servers outside your country. For more information, see Google's
            Privacy Policy at
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">policies.google.com/privacy</a>
            and "How Google uses information from sites that use our services" at
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a>.
          </p>

          <p>
            Google Analytics only runs if you accept analytics. We do not send
            tool inputs to Google Analytics: pasted lists, quotations, customer
            details and AI-generated text are not transmitted or recorded as
            analytics events.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>3. Cookies and your choices</h2>
          <p>
            We use cookies and similar technologies for the following purposes:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <strong>Essential functionality and security</strong> — required
              for the site to work and to operate securely.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Analytics</strong> — Google Analytics 4 sets first-party
              cookies (for example <code>_ga</code> and
              <code>_ga_GT7Q9ETXYM</code>) to distinguish visitors and sessions.
              These are used for measurement and are not strictly necessary.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Advertising</strong> — not currently used. If advertising
              is introduced, it may set additional cookies or identifiers; see
              section 4.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <p>
            <strong>Consent.</strong> Google Analytics does not load, send
            requests or set analytics cookies until you accept it. When you first
            visit, an equally prominent <strong>Accept</strong> and
            <strong>Reject</strong> choice is shown, and no analytics runs before
            you decide. Your choice is stored in your browser so it is remembered
            on later visits. You can change or withdraw it at any time using the
            <strong>Cookie settings</strong> control in the site footer; rejecting
            or withdrawing stops analytics and clears the Google Analytics
            cookies. Google Consent Mode v2 is used, with analytics and
            advertising storage denied by default and advertising storage kept
            denied because no advertising is implemented.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>4. Advertising</h2>
          <p>
            KRIYANO may display advertising in the future, including advertising
            provided by third-party advertising networks such as Google AdSense.
          </p>

          <p>
            Advertising providers may use cookies or other technologies to
            deliver, measure or personalise advertisements where permitted.
            Additional disclosures may be added to this Privacy Policy when such
            services are implemented.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>5. Third-party links and services</h2>
          <p>
            KRIYANO may contain links to third-party websites, AI platforms,
            software, products or services. KRIYANO is not responsible for the
            privacy practices, content or policies of external websites.
          </p>

          <p>
            Visitors should review the privacy policies of third-party services
            before providing personal information to them.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>6. Tool inputs and AI processing</h2>
          <p>The Spreadsheet List Cleaner, Margin &amp; Markup Calculator, Quotation Builder and AI Prompt Builder process their inputs in your browser. These tools do not upload inputs to KRIYANO or automatically save them to a database or browser storage. Downloaded files and copied results are under your control. Your browser may retain form state through its own features.</p>
          <p>KRIYANO CHECK’s local check extracts signals in your browser. Selecting its online AI review sends the entered text to KRIYANO’s server and Cloudflare Workers AI for processing. The application does not intentionally save your text or review to a database and does not log the submitted text. Hosting and AI service processing is subject to the providers’ practices; this is not a promise of zero provider retention.</p>
          <p>Do not submit confidential information, credentials or personal records to the online review. You can use the local check without requesting an AI review. When you copy a prompt into another AI service, that service’s privacy practices apply.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>7. Data security</h2>
          <p>
            Reasonable technical measures are used to help protect the website
            and its infrastructure. However, no internet transmission or online
            service can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>8. Children's privacy</h2>
          <p>
            KRIYANO is intended as a general information, productivity and
            educational website and is not specifically directed toward young
            children.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>
            This Privacy Policy may be updated when KRIYANO introduces new
            features, analytics systems, advertising services, forms, downloads,
            accounts or other functionality.
          </p>

          <p>
            The latest version will be published on this page together with an
            updated revision date.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>10. Contact</h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, you can contact
            KRIYANO through the contact information provided on the website.
          </p>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-hero {
    padding: 100px 0 70px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 80% 20%,
        rgba(183, 255, 74, 0.08),
        transparent 30%
      ),
      var(--bg);
  }

  .legal-hero h1 {
    margin-top: 16px;
    max-width: 850px;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.8rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
  }

  .legal-intro {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-top: 26px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .updated {
    margin-top: 20px;
    color: var(--lime);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .legal-section {
    padding: 85px 0 110px;
  }

  .legal-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 820px);
  }

  .legal-content {
    display: grid;
    gap: 48px;
  }

  .legal-content section {
    padding-bottom: 40px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .legal-content section:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    margin-top: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .legal-content p:first-of-type {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .legal-hero {
      padding: 64px 0 48px;
    }

    .legal-hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 13vw, 4rem);
    }

    .legal-intro {
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .legal-section {
      padding: 58px 0 75px;
    }

    .legal-content {
      gap: 34px;
    }

    .legal-content section {
      padding-bottom: 32px;
    }
  }
</style>